{"ex-205-1":{"id":"ex-205-1","chapter":"205","number":1,"title":"拉閘時產生的力矩","question":"<p>男孩用不同方法以 10 N 的力拉閘門，如下列俯視圖所示。求在各情況中，力對門鉸產生的力矩。</p><p>(a) (b)</p><p>0.8 m 60° 10 N</p><p>(c) (d)</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/figures-chn/a3f3214b9e9efccfdacd7444.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:472.3px\"/></p>","answer":"<p>應用 τ = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Fd</annotation></semantics></math></span> sin θ。</p><p>(a) 力矩 = 10 × 0.8 × sin 90° = 8 N m（順時針）</p><p>(b) 力矩 = 10 × 0.8 × sin 60° = 6.93 N m（逆時針）</p><p>(c) 力矩 = 10 × 0.8 × sin 120° = 6.93 N m（順時針）</p><p>(d) 力矩 = 10 × 0.8 × sin 180° = 0</p>","tips":"<p>提示</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/2e645ecd56160ea90e2211b4.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:185.5px\"></p><p>提示</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/495c3d67f5d42027da455ade.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:185.5px\"></p>","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_205_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"95813f172c8d58aa379dcb347634120cd5c5f402e2d7e11d59ff0238ea42360f","segments":[{"page":5,"kind":"question","box":[188.2833009033203,277.9479833984375,565.4833009033202,564.3946685791016],"text":"例 題 1 拉閘時產生的力矩\r\n男孩用不同方法以 10 N 的力拉閘門，如下列俯視圖所示。求在各情\r\n況中，力對門鉸產生的力矩。\r\n(a)\r\n10 N\r\n0.8 m\r\n門鉸\r\n閘門\r\n(b)\r\n10 N\r\n60°\r\n0.8 m\r\n(c)\r\n10 N\r\n60°\r\n0.8 m\r\n(d)\r\n10 N\r\n0.8 m\r\n"},{"page":5,"kind":"answer","box":[188.2833009033203,564.3946685791016,565.4833009033202,712.9319833984375],"text":"題解\r\n應用 τ = Fd sin θ。\r\n(a) 力矩 = 10 × 0.8 × sin 90° = 8 N m（順時針）\r\n(b) 力矩 = 10 × 0.8 × sin 60° = 6.93 N m（逆時針）\r\n(c) 力矩 = 10 × 0.8 × sin 120° = 6.93 N m（順時針）\r\n(d) 力矩 = 10 × 0.8 × sin 180° = 0\r\n"},{"page":5,"kind":"tips","box":[40,273.9479833984375,184.2833009033203,712.9319833984375],"text":"提提你\r\n60° 120°\r\n0.8 m\r\n提提你\r\n180°\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete source artwork with reviewed Chinese labels and English-aligned text corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-205-2":{"id":"ex-205-2","chapter":"205","number":2,"title":"作用於輪子的淨力矩","question":"<p>小孩 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span> 和 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q</annotation></semantics></math></span> 轉動半徑為 0.2 m 的輪子。求以下各情況中，對輪子中心點 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O</annotation></semantics></math></span> 作用的淨力矩。</p><p>(a) <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span> 以 3 N 的力向上推，<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q</annotation></semantics></math></span> 以 5 N 的力向下推（圖 a）</p><p>(b) <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span> 以 3 N 的力向上推，<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q</annotation></semantics></math></span> 以 5 N 的力向上推（圖 b）</p><p>圖</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/945a4ebfaaff9b8ed75d94cf.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:526.1px\"/></p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/figures-chn/71b55c6597b0be3406636f0c.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:41.4px\"/></p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/figures-chn/e4d322225b03cec983da091c.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:42.2px\"/></p>","answer":"<p>取順時針方向為正。應用 τ = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi><msub><mi>d</mi><mtext>⊥</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Fd_{⊥}</annotation></semantics></math></span>。</p><p>(a) τ<sub>net</sub> = 3 × 0.2 + 5 × 0.2 = 1.6 N m 淨力矩是 1.6 N m（順時針）。</p><p>(b) τ<sub>net</sub> = 3 × 0.2 − 5 × 0.2 = − 0.4 N m 淨力矩是 0.4 N m（逆時針）。</p>","tips":"","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_205_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"95813f172c8d58aa379dcb347634120cd5c5f402e2d7e11d59ff0238ea42360f","segments":[{"page":7,"kind":"question","box":[188.08330090332032,192.05698339843752,565.2833009033203,486.4230499267578],"text":"例 題 2 作用於輪子的淨力矩\r\n小孩 P 和 Q 轉動半徑為 0.2 m 的輪子。求以下各情況中，對輪子中\r\n心點 O 作用的淨力矩。\r\n(a) P 以 3 N 的力向上推，Q 以 5 N 的力向下推（圖 a）\r\n(b) P 以 3 N 的力向上推，Q 以 5 N 的力向上推（圖 b）\r\n3 N\r\n5 N\r\n0.2 m\r\nP O Q\r\n圖 a\r\n3 N\r\n5 N\r\n0.2 m\r\nP O Q\r\n圖 b\r\n"},{"page":7,"kind":"answer","box":[188.08330090332032,486.4230499267578,565.2833009033203,629.1599833984375],"text":"題解\r\n取順時針方向為正。應用 τ = Fd⊥。\r\n(a) τ net = 3 × 0.2 + 5 × 0.2 = 1.6 N m\r\n淨力矩是 1.6 N m（順時針）。\r\n(b) τ net = 3 × 0.2 − 5 × 0.2 = − 0.4 N m\r\n淨力矩是 0.4 N m（逆時針）。\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete source artwork with reviewed Chinese labels and English-aligned text corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-205-3":{"id":"ex-205-3","chapter":"205","number":3,"title":"哪一把直尺處於平衡狀態？","question":"<p>輕的直尺 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">AB</annotation></semantics></math></span> 長 50 cm，起初在光滑的水平桌面上靜止不動。<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O</annotation></semantics></math></span> 是直尺的中點。下列各俯視圖顯示兩道力以三種不同的方法作用於直尺。</p><p>(i) (ii) B B 5 N</p><p>O O</p><p>A 5 N 5 N A 5 N</p><p>(a) 求在各情況中作用於直尺的淨力，以及對 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O</annotation></semantics></math></span> 點和 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span> 點的淨力矩。</p><p>取向右和順時針方向為正。</p><p>(b) 直尺在上述哪一種情況處於平衡狀態？</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/c9354058c8c7b84514b8f3ab.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:536.9px\"/></p>","answer":"<div class=\"study-table-wrap\"><table><tbody><tr><td><p></p></td><td><p>(i)</p></td><td><p>(ii)</p></td><td><p>(iii)</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>淨力</p></td><td><p><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>F</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F_{net}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 5 − 5 = 0</p></td><td><p><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>F</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F_{net}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 5 + 5 = 10 N</p></td><td><p><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>F</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F_{net}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 5 − 5 = 0</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>對 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O</annotation></semantics></math></span> 的淨力矩</p></td><td><p>τ<sub>net</sub> = 5 × 0.25 − 5 × 0.25 = 0</p></td><td><p>τ<sub>net</sub> = 5 × 0.25 − 5 × 0.25 = 0</p></td><td><p>τ<sub>net</sub> = − 5 × 0.25 − 5 × 0.25 = − 2.5 N m</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>對 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span> 的淨力矩</p></td><td><p>τ<sub>net</sub> = 0</p></td><td><p>τ<sub>net</sub> = 5 × 0.5 = 2.5 N m</p></td><td><p>τ<sub>net</sub> = − 5 × 0.5 = − 2.5 N m</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>(a)</p><p>(b) 情況 (i)</p>","tips":"<p>提示</p><p>本例中，合力為零；以尺上不同點為轉軸，合力矩亦為零。</p>","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_205_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"95813f172c8d58aa379dcb347634120cd5c5f402e2d7e11d59ff0238ea42360f","segments":[{"page":12,"kind":"question","box":[183.2833009033203,276.87198339843746,560.2833009033203,542.4063568115234],"text":"例 題 3 哪一把直尺處於平衡狀態？\r\n輕的直尺 AB 長 50 cm，起初在光滑的水平桌面上靜止不動。O 是直\r\n尺的中點。下列各俯視圖顯示兩道力以三種不同的方法作用於直尺。\r\nA\r\nO\r\n5 N 5 N\r\nB\r\n(i)\r\nA\r\nB\r\nO\r\n5 N\r\n5 N\r\n(ii)\r\nA\r\nO\r\n5 N\r\n5 N B\r\n(iii)\r\n(a) 求在各情況中作用於直尺的淨力，以及對 O 點和 A 點的淨力矩。\r\n取向右和順時針方向為正。\r\n(b) 直尺在上述哪一種情況處於平衡狀態？\r\n"},{"page":12,"kind":"answer","box":[183.2833009033203,542.4063568115234,560.2833009033203,746.2039833984375],"text":"題解\r\n(a) (i) (ii) (iii)\r\n淨 力 Fnet = 5 − 5 = 0 Fnet = 5 + 5 = 10 N Fnet = 5 − 5 = 0\r\n對 O 的\r\n淨力矩\r\nτ net = 5 × 0.25 \r\n− 5 × 0.25 \r\n= 0\r\nτ net = 5 × 0.25 \r\n− 5 × 0.25 \r\n= 0\r\nτ net = − 5 × 0.25 \r\n− 5 × 0.25 \r\n= − 2.5 N m\r\n對 A 的\r\n淨力矩\r\nτ net = 0 τ net = 5 × 0.5 \r\n = 2.5 N m\r\nτ net = − 5 × 0.5 \r\n= − 2.5 N m\r\n(b) 情況 (i)\r\n"},{"page":12,"kind":"tips","box":[40,272.87198339843746,179.2833009033203,746.2039833984375],"text":" (iii) 的兩道力是一對力偶，\r\n兩者之間的垂直距離是50 cm。\r\nτ 的量值 = 5 × 0.5 = 2.5 N m\r\n在力作用的位置計算力矩\r\n時，d⊥ 是 零，所 以 力 矩 也\r\n是零。\r\n提提你\r\n在這個情況中，沒有淨力作\r\n用於直尺，而且對直尺上不\r\n同位置的淨力矩也是零。\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete source artwork with reviewed Chinese labels and English-aligned text corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-205-4":{"id":"ex-205-4","chapter":"205","number":4,"title":"處於平衡狀態的樹幹？","question":"<p>一隻猴子在倒下的樹幹上行走，樹幹由位於 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>X</mtext></mrow></mrow></math> 和 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>Y</mtext></mrow></mrow></math> 的兩塊石頭水平支撐。兩塊石頭相距 1 m。猴子重 300 N，樹幹重 240 N，樹幹的重心距離 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>X</mtext></mrow></mrow></math> 為 0.4 m。猴子位於 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>X</mtext></mrow></mrow></math> 左方 0.1 m 處。樹幹保持靜止。</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/e533c19c5f2c7de07356e843.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:484.6px\"></p><p>(a) 位於 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>X</mtext></mrow></mrow></math> 和 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>Y</mtext></mrow></mrow></math> 的石頭分別向樹幹施加鉛直力 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>F</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>X</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow></math> 和 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>F</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>Y</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow></math>。求這兩個力的大小。</p><p>(b) 猴子向左走去摘香蕉。在樹幹不翻倒的情況下，牠與 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>X</mtext></mrow></mrow></math> 的最大距離 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>d</mtext></mrow></mrow></math> 是多少？</p>","answer":"<p>(a) 樹幹的隔離體圖：</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/e3137edf709b1ece612080a7.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:250.7px\"></p><p>對 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Y</annotation></semantics></math></span> 點計算力矩。</p><p>順時針合力矩 = 逆時針合力矩</p><p><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>X</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F_{X}</annotation></semantics></math></span> × 1 = 300 × (0.1 + 1) + 240 × (1 − 0.4)</p><p><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>X</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F_{X}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 474 N</p><p>對 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X</annotation></semantics></math></span> 點計算力矩。</p><p>順時針合力矩 = 逆時針合力矩</p><p>240 × 0.4 = 300 × 0.1 + <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>Y</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F_{Y}</annotation></semantics></math></span> × 1</p><p><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>Y</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F_{Y}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 66 N</p><p>(b) 樹幹的隔離體圖：</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/34d1d623d02b547aa3a4235a.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:250.7px\"></p><p>對 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X</annotation></semantics></math></span> 點計算力矩。</p><p>順時針合力矩 = 逆時針合力矩</p><p>240 × 0.4 = 300 × <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span></p><p><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 0.32 m</p>","tips":"<p>技巧</p><p>解難</p><p>處於平衡的物體</p><p class=\"numbered-step\">① 畫出物體的自由體圖。</p><p class=\"numbered-step\">② 建立方程使用 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>F</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>n</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>e</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>t</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow></math> = 0。</p><p class=\"numbered-step\">③ 建立方程使用繞任何一點的 τ<sub>net</sub> = 0。</p><p>如有可能，選取一點，使所建立的方程只有一個未知數。</p><p class=\"numbered-step\">④ 解方程。</p><p>提示</p><p>由於 F<sub>Y</sub> 所產生的力矩為 0，這條方程只有一個未知數。</p><p>提示</p><p>如果猴子走得太接近左端，樹幹便會繞 X 逆時針轉動。在這情況剛要發生時，樹幹即將離開位於 Y 的石頭，因此 F<sub>Y</sub> = 0。</p>","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_205_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"95813f172c8d58aa379dcb347634120cd5c5f402e2d7e11d59ff0238ea42360f","segments":[{"page":17,"kind":"question","box":[188.28297420332035,139.07118519843755,565.2829742033204,483.15406799316406],"text":"例 題 4 處於平衡狀態的樹幹？\r\n一根樹枝倒下後，由兩個石塊在 X 點和 Y 點支撐，並保持水平。樹\r\n幹的重量是 240 N，重心與 X 點相距 0.4 m。重量為 300 N 的猴子\r\n沿着樹幹走到 X 點左方 0.1 m，樹幹保持靜止不動。\r\n240 N\r\n0.4 m\r\nX Y\r\n1 m 0.1 m\r\n(a) 在 X 點和 Y 點的石塊分別對樹幹施加垂直力 FX 和 FY。求這兩道\r\n力的量值。\r\n(b) 猴子再往左走摘香蕉。要保持樹幹不翻側，牠與 X 點的最大距離\r\nd 可以是多少？\r\n"},{"page":17,"kind":"answer","box":[188.28297420332035,483.15406799316406,565.2829742033204,755.0241851984375],"text":"題解\r\n(a) 樹幹的隔離體圖：\r\n240 N\r\n0.4 m\r\nX Y\r\n300 N\r\n1 m 0.1 m\r\nFX FY\r\n對 Y 點計算力矩。\r\n順時針合力矩 = 逆時針合力矩\r\nFX × 1 = 300 × (0.1 + 1) + 240 × (1 − 0.4)\r\n FX = 474 N\r\n對 X 點計算力矩。\r\n順時針合力矩 = 逆時針合力矩\r\n 240 × 0.4 = 300 × 0.1 + FY × 1\r\n FY = 66 N\r\n"},{"page":17,"kind":"tips","box":[40,135.07118519843755,184.28297420332035,755.0241851984375],"text":"提提你\r\n由於 FY 產生的力矩是0，\r\n這方程只有一個未知數。\r\n也可以考慮垂直方向並應\r\n用Fnet = 0來求FY。\r\n, , \r\n18(1B)Q5, 19(1A)Q7, \r\n20(1A)Q7, 23(1A)Q12, etc\r\n處於平衡狀態的物\r\n體\r\n① 繪畫物體的隔離體\r\n圖。\r\n② 應用 Fnet = 0 建立方\r\n程。\r\n③ 挑選一點來應用 τ net\r\n= 0 建立方程。盡可\r\n能 選 出 合 適 的 點，\r\n讓方程只包含一個\r\n未知數。\r\n④ 解方程。\r\n技巧分析\r\n解 難\r\n技巧分析\r\n 可到牛津物理網下載教學\r\n筆記和練習。\r\n"},{"page":18,"kind":"answer","box":[183.48300090332032,53.334106398437484,560.4830009033203,279.4581063984375],"text":"(b) 樹幹的隔離體圖：\r\n240 N\r\n0.4 m X Y\r\n300 N\r\nFX\r\nd\r\n對 X 點計算力矩。\r\n順時針合力矩 = 逆時針合力矩\r\n 240 × 0.4 = 300 × d\r\nd = 0.32 m\r\n"},{"page":18,"kind":"tips","box":[40,49.334106398437484,179.48300090332032,279.4581063984375],"text":"提提你\r\n如果猴子走得太近樹幹的左\r\n端，樹幹就會沿 X 點向逆\r\n時針方向轉動。在這情況\r\n發生前，樹幹與 Y 點的石\r\n頭快將分離，因此 FY = 0。\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete source artwork with reviewed Chinese labels and English-aligned text corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["question","tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-205-5":{"id":"ex-205-5","chapter":"205","number":5,"title":"作用於梯子的力","question":"<p>梯子 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi><mi>Y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">XY</annotation></semantics></math></span> 長 3 m，靠在光滑的牆上靜止不動，它的頂端剛好貼着離地 2 m 的窗。已知梯子是均勻而對稱的物體，質量是 5 kg。</p><p>求地面作用於梯子的法向力和摩擦力。</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/figures-chn/358c9cf8b3eeb32b0d01a709.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:229.7px\"/></p>","answer":"<p>梯子的自由體圖如右圖所示。</p><p>考慮鉛直方向。取向上為正方向。</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>F</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>n</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>e</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>t</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow></math> = 0</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>R</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>g</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow></math> + (−<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>m</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>g</mtext></mrow></mrow></math>) = 0</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>R</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>g</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow></math> − 5 × 9.81 = 0</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/figures-chn/ed1e0367da90edacca7fff0d.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:202.2px\"></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>R</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>g</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow></math> = 49.05 N</p><p>≈ 49.1 N</p><p>取繞 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>X</mtext></mrow></mrow></math> 的力矩。</p><p>順時針力矩總和 = 逆時針力矩總和</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>f</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>×</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>+</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>m</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>g</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>×</mtext></mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><msqrt><mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>3</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msup><mrow><mtext>−</mtext></mrow><msup><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow></msqrt></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac><mrow><mtext>=</mtext></mrow><msub><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>R</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>g</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msub><mrow><mtext>×</mtext></mrow><msqrt><mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>3</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msup><mrow><mtext>−</mtext></mrow><msup><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow></msqrt></mrow></math></p><p>2<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>f</mtext></mrow></mrow></math> + 5 × 9.81 × <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><msqrt><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>5</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msqrt></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></math> = 49.05 × <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msqrt><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>5</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msqrt></mrow></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>f</mtext></mrow></mrow></math> = 27.4 N</p><p>法向力為 49.1 N（向上），而</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/675c803c5f229996b2df26dc.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:144.7px\"></p><p>摩擦力為 27.4 N（向左）。</p>","tips":"<p>提示</p><p>由於梯子的 Y 端有向右滑動的趨勢，摩擦力指向左方。</p>","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_205_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"95813f172c8d58aa379dcb347634120cd5c5f402e2d7e11d59ff0238ea42360f","segments":[{"page":18,"kind":"question","box":[183.2833009033203,294.24698339843746,560.2833009033203,459.5626678466797],"text":"例 題 5 作用於梯子的力\r\n梯子 XY 長 3 m，靠在光滑的牆上靜\r\n止不動，它的頂端剛好貼着離地 2 m\r\n的窗。已知梯子是均勻而對稱的物\r\n體，質量是 5 kg。\r\n求地面作用於梯子的法向力和摩擦力。\r\n"},{"page":18,"kind":"answer","box":[183.2833009033203,459.5626678466797,560.2833009033203,757.0999833984375],"text":"題解\r\n梯子的隔離體圖如右圖所示。\r\n考慮垂直方向，取向上為正。\r\nFnet = 0\r\nRg + (–mg) = 0\r\nRg − 5 × 9.81 = 0\r\nRg = 49.05 N\r\n≈ 49.1 N\r\n對 X 點計算力矩。\r\n順時針合力矩 = 逆時針合力矩\r\nf × 2 + mg ×\r\n•\r\n32\r\n − 22\r\n2 = Rg × •\r\n32\r\n – 22\r\n 2f + 5 × 9.81 ×\r\n•\r\n5\r\n2 = 49.05 × •\r\n5\r\nf = 27.4 N\r\n法向力是向上 49.1 N，摩擦力是向左 27.4 N。\r\nX\r\nY\r\n2 m\r\n3 m\r\n窗\r\n光滑的牆 梯子\r\n地面\r\nY\r\nX 牆施加的\r\n法向力 Rw\r\n地面施加的\r\n重量 mg 法向力 Rg\r\n摩擦力 f\r\n2 3\r\n32 – 22\r\n32 – 22\r\n2\r\n"},{"page":18,"kind":"tips","box":[40,290.24698339843746,179.2833009033203,757.0999833984375],"text":"提提你\r\n梯子的 Y 端傾向往右滑，\r\n因此摩擦力指向左。\r\n 物體受重力作用時，重心\r\n會移到較低的地方。老師可\r\n讓學生觀看以下影片，然後\r\n請他們解釋看到的現象。\r\n另一個方法是對 Y 點計算\r\n力矩，並考慮水平方向的淨\r\n力。\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete source artwork with reviewed Chinese labels and English-aligned text corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["answer","tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"}}